This project formalizes and investigates
arguments from Alessandro Maria Masullo’s
manuscript: The Music of the Primes.

Masullo's manuscript is explicitly not
checked-in. The LICENSE file covers all
derived and original work present.

This project uses https://patel.codes/godel,
an experimental abstraction beyond the
agentic coding harness.

https://github.com/mccorvie/riemann-masullo
is the canonical formalization of Masullo's
manuscript and vendors from this project as
described in its ATTRIBUTION.md.
